#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:78
msgid ""
"``port`` can be a :class:`Pin` object, or an integer (``1`` or ``2``) "
"selecting DAC channel 1 or 2. The physical pin each channel is routed to "
"depends on the OpenMV Cam."
msgstr ""
"``port`` dapat berupa objek :class:`Pin`\\ , atau bilangan bulat (\\ ``1`` "
"atau ``2``\\ ) yang memilih saluran DAC 1 atau 2. Pin fisik yang dirutekan "
"ke setiap saluran bergantung pada OpenMV Cam."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:82
msgid ""
"``bits`` is an integer specifying the resolution, and can be 8 or 12. The "
"maximum value accepted by :meth:`write` and :meth:`write_timed` is "
"``(2**bits) - 1`` (255 for 8-bit, 4095 for 12-bit)."
msgstr ""
"``bits`` adalah bilangan bulat yang menentukan resolusi, dan dapat bernilai "
"8 atau 12. Nilai maksimum yang diterima oleh :meth:`write` dan "
":meth:`write_timed` adalah ``(2**bits) - 1`` (255 untuk 8-bit, 4095 untuk "
"12-bit)."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:86
msgid ""
"The *buffering* parameter selects the behaviour of the DAC op-amp output "
"buffer, whose purpose is to reduce the output impedance.  It can be ``None``"
" to select the default (buffering enabled for :meth:`DAC.noise`, "
":meth:`DAC.triangle` and :meth:`DAC.write_timed`, and disabled for "
":meth:`DAC.write`), ``False`` to disable buffering completely, or ``True`` "
"to enable output buffering."
msgstr ""
"Parameter *buffering* memilih perilaku buffer output op-amp DAC, yang "
"bertujuan mengurangi impedansi output. Nilainya dapat berupa ``None`` untuk "
"memilih default (buffering diaktifkan untuk :meth:`DAC.noise`\\ , "
":meth:`DAC.triangle` dan :meth:`DAC.write_timed`\\ , dan dinonaktifkan untuk"
" :meth:`DAC.write`\\ ), ``False`` untuk menonaktifkan buffering sepenuhnya, "
"atau ``True`` untuk mengaktifkan buffer output."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:93
msgid ""
"When buffering is enabled the DAC pin can drive loads down to 5KΩ. Otherwise"
" it has an output impedance of 15KΩ maximum: consequently to achieve a 1% "
"accuracy without buffering requires the applied load to be less than 1.5MΩ."
"  Using the buffer incurs a penalty in accuracy, especially near the "
"extremes of range."
msgstr ""
"Ketika buffering diaktifkan, pin DAC dapat menggerakkan beban hingga 5KΩ. "
"Sebaliknya, impedansi outputnya maksimal 15KΩ: oleh karena itu, untuk "
"mencapai akurasi 1% tanpa buffering, beban yang diterapkan harus kurang dari"
" 1,5MΩ. Penggunaan buffer menimbulkan penalti pada akurasi, terutama di "
"dekat batas-batas rentang."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:100
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:104
msgid ""
"Reinitialise the DAC.  *bits* can be 8 or 12.  *buffering* can be ``None``, "
"``False`` or ``True``; see above constructor for the meaning of this "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"Inisialisasi ulang DAC. *bits* dapat bernilai 8 atau 12. *buffering* dapat "
"berupa ``None``\\ , ``False`` atau ``True``\\ ; lihat konstruktor di atas "
"untuk arti parameter ini."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:110
msgid "De-initialise the DAC making its pin available for other uses."
msgstr "De-inisialisasi DAC sehingga pin-nya tersedia untuk penggunaan lain."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:114
msgid ""
"Generate a pseudo-random noise signal.  A new random sample is written to "
"the DAC output at the given frequency."
msgstr ""
"Hasilkan sinyal noise pseudo-acak. Sampel acak baru ditulis ke output DAC "
"pada frekuensi yang diberikan."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:119
msgid ""
"Generate a triangle wave.  The value on the DAC output changes at the given "
"frequency and ramps through the full 12-bit range (up and down). Therefore "
"the frequency of the repeating triangle wave itself is 8192 times smaller."
msgstr ""
"Hasilkan gelombang segitiga. Nilai pada output DAC berubah pada frekuensi "
"yang diberikan dan merampa melalui rentang penuh 12-bit (naik dan turun). "
"Oleh karena itu frekuensi gelombang segitiga yang berulang itu sendiri 8192 "
"kali lebih kecil."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:125
msgid ""
"Direct access to the DAC output. The minimum value is ``0``; the maximum is "
"``(2**bits) - 1``, where ``bits`` is set when creating the DAC object or via"
" :meth:`init`."
msgstr ""
"Akses langsung ke output DAC. Nilai minimum adalah ``0``\\ ; nilai maksimum "
"adalah ``(2**bits) - 1``\\ , di mana ``bits`` ditetapkan saat membuat objek "
"DAC atau melalui :meth:`init`\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:131
msgid ""
"Initiates a burst of RAM to DAC using a DMA transfer. The input data is "
"treated as an array of bytes in 8-bit mode, and an array of unsigned half-"
"words (array typecode 'H') in 12-bit mode."
msgstr ""
"Memulai burst RAM ke DAC menggunakan transfer DMA. Data input diperlakukan "
"sebagai array byte dalam mode 8-bit, dan array half-word unsigned (typecode "
"array 'H') dalam mode 12-bit."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:135
msgid ""
"``freq`` can be an integer specifying the frequency to write the DAC samples"
" at, using Timer(6).  Or it can be an already-initialised Timer object which"
" is used to trigger the DAC sample.  Valid timers are 2, 4, 5, 6, 7 and 8."
msgstr ""
"``freq`` dapat berupa bilangan bulat yang menentukan frekuensi penulisan "
"sampel DAC, menggunakan Timer(6). Atau dapat berupa objek Timer yang sudah "
"diinisialisasi yang digunakan untuk memicu sampel DAC. Timer yang valid "
"adalah 2, 4, 5, 6, 7 dan 8."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:140
msgid "``mode`` can be ``DAC.NORMAL`` or ``DAC.CIRCULAR``."
msgstr "``mode`` dapat berupa ``DAC.NORMAL`` atau ``DAC.CIRCULAR``\\ ."

