msgstr "Contoh penggunaan kedua DAC secara bersamaan::"

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:150
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstanta"

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:155
msgid ""
"``NORMAL`` mode does a single transmission of the waveform in the data "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"Mode ``NORMAL`` melakukan transmisi tunggal gelombang dalam buffer data."

#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:161
msgid ""
"``CIRCULAR`` mode transmits the waveform in the data buffer and wraps around"
" to the start of the buffer every time it reaches the end, producing a "
"continuous loop until :meth:`deinit` is called."
msgstr ""
"Mode ``CIRCULAR`` mentransmisikan gelombang dalam buffer data dan kembali ke"
" awal buffer setiap kali mencapai akhir, menghasilkan loop berkelanjutan "
"hingga :meth:`deinit` dipanggil."
